{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Well, I [C]dream of a girl and a stern-wheel steamboat
A [F]pilothouse stove and [G]engine room brass
[C]Hanging on a post by the [F]main deck [C]stairway
With a long hair skippin' in the [G]Mississippi [C]dew
{end_of_verse}

